:: Out_of_Stamina
    <<speech plr>>I am so tired...maybe I can manage to get back to my bed...<</speech>>
    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-1'>
            <<button [[Space out | Residence_Starr_PlayerRoom_Resting]]>>
                <<setStats plr stamina 1>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>

:: Out_of_Life
    <<speech plr>>Holy shit, there is so much blood...is that really all mine? I had no idea there....could.....be......so.......muchhh..........<</speech>>
    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-1'>
            <<button [[The life ebbs from your broken body | University_Admin_Clinic]]>>
                <<setStats plr life 5>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>

:: Out_of_Sanity
    <<speech plr>>ARGHHHGHHHHHHHH!!!! IT'S ALL A LIE!?!?!?<</speech>>

    <<nobr>>
        <div class='passage-links-grid-1'>
            <<button '(mental break)'>>
                <<goto 'University_MainRoad'>>
                <<setStats plr sanity 2>>
            <</button>>
        </div>
    <</nobr>>